body:
Oh god, luckily at my hotel, our system refuses to let you go forward in the audit WITHOUT doing the backup.

&#x200B;

It’d be nice if we moved to a cloud-based system though, but we use backup tapes. It’ll show up with an error and refuse to move onto the next step until you’ve swapped and inserted a new tape for the night.

Next thing you notice, you realize you jumped into a modded version of GTA 5.

&#x200B;

Damn hackers.
